{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>將軍澳有人猝死。今日（3日）下午4時42分，警方接獲怡明邨一名保安報案，指怡悅樓一單位傳出異味，懷疑有人暈倒屋內。</p><p>救援人員接報趕至，消防破門而入，發現單位內一名54歲姓梁男住戶倒臥浴室。救護員檢驗後證實梁男已明顯死亡。警方將安排為他驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"將軍澳怡明邨怡悅樓有住戶倒斃屋內。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230718/757903998262317056937862.jpeg/KxGCEnBDMhnT_BbtLNRLeh6KM67bhAIAssMmo4jDJqM\"/><figcaption>將軍澳怡明邨怡悅樓有住戶倒斃屋內。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.310351+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:23:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:52.805051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:52.484919+00:00","content_hash":"7d83c7a7cede8d7f26de58ec0108d8a1cb52e4e9613b8b8dcf19e7c159317fcb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}